am": {"id": "c11_rite_bram", "title": "c11_rite_bram", "desc": "", "status": "done"}, "c11_rite_ilse": {"id": "c11_rite_ilse", "title": "c11_rite_ilse", "desc": "", "status": "done"}, "c11_rite_corvin": {"id": "c11_rite_corvin", "title": "c11_rite_corvin", "desc": "Corvin flew into the Stormwall and stayed at the helm. The wreck of the Kingfisher hangs in the eye of the storm.", "status": "active"}}, "journal": ["We found the Gull's Return. Dad's cutlass was under the thwart. Mom's hand-lamp was tied to the mast with a Keeper's knot. She went out after him. She left the Lantern dark and went out after him, and she never told me.", "Nell reforged Dad's cutlass in Sun Shard fire. Edrin's Blade. It's light in my hand. I said hi to it. Nobody laughed.", "We found Tilly at Scrapfall with a rusty kitchen knife she'd stolen from a giant bird. Pip started to shout at her and then he didn't. He asked if she was scared. He said he was too.", "Pip and Tilly flew a kite off the stern. Bram broke it. Everyone laughed, including Pip. We dropped Tilly home at Kiteholm after.", "Nell turned Tilly's rusty knife into Pip's Lucky Shiv. She kept the ribbon on. Pip says it was stolen from the best. He means Tilly.", "Bram stood the vigil. He shook the whole night and didn't move. At dawn he took Sir Aldous's sword from the cairn and Corvin knighted him. Sir Bram Kestrel. He keeps saying it under his breath.", "Ilse took Osk's staff. Before she did, she told me everything she wants. It was a long list. I was on it. She says she forgave me a long time ago and just liked being angry. That's the most Ilse thing anyone has ever said."]}, "chapter": 11, "playtime": 306.4466999999748, "location": {"mapId": "c11_stormwall", "x": 14, "y": 22, "dir": "up", "name": "The Eye of the Stormwall"}, "unlockedCrests": ["vanguard", "mender", "warden", "rogue"], "bestiary": {"c11_undertow": {"seen": 1, "defeated": 1, "weak": ["slash"], "moves": ["e_spit", "e_tidal"]}, "c11_scrap_rook": {"seen": 2, "defeate